{"text": "发您一个红包赔罪", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "apologize", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["fluent"], "note": ""}
{"text": "退您一部分钱，剩下的货照发", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "resend", "pol": "+", "when": null}], "tags": ["fluent"], "note": ""}
{"text": "这单我们免单", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["fragment"], "note": ""}
{"text": "下单赠送双倍积分，算我们诚意", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["fluent"], "note": ""}
{"text": "您要是想退，我们全额退，不扣手续费", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["conditional"], "note": ""}
{"text": "要是您今天点头，我们明天就发", "frames": [{"act": "resend", "pol": "+", "when": "tomorrow"}], "tags": ["conditional"], "note": ""}
{"text": "打个七折，行吗", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["question"], "note": "提议以疑问形式出现，按规则3为none"}
{"text": "您说想要折扣是吧，没问题，给您九折", "frames": [{"act": "discount", "pol": "+", "pct": 10}], "tags": ["quote"], "note": ""}
{"text": "减百分之十，您看看", "frames": [{"act": "discount", "pol": "+", "pct": 10}], "tags": ["fluent"], "note": ""}
{"text": "好的，您说今天内处理，我们一定做到", "frames": [{"act": "agree", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["fluent"], "note": ""}
{"text": "行，就照您说的", "frames": [{"act": "agree", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["fragment"], "note": ""}
{"text": "同意您的方案，我们配合", "frames": [{"act": "agree", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["fluent"], "note": ""}
{"text": "多谢您的理解，合作愉快", "frames": [{"act": "thanks", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "closing", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["fluent"], "note": ""}
{"text": "感谢您一直支持我们", "frames": [{"act": "thanks", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["fluent"], "note": ""}
{"text": "谢谢，祝您生意兴隆，再会", "frames": [{"act": "thanks", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "closing", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["fluent"], "note": ""}
{"text": "您好，请问是张老板吗", "frames": [{"act": "greet", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["question"], "note": ""}
{"text": "午安，我是仓管阿强", "frames": [{"act": "greet", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["fragment"], "note": ""}
{"text": "听说您昨晚没睡好，别太累", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["offtopic"], "note": ""}
{"text": "大后天之前一定到，我拿人头担保", "frames": [{"act": "promise_time", "pol": "+", "when": "friday"}], "tags": ["fluent"], "note": ""}
{"text": "最迟礼拜六您就收到", "frames": [{"act": "promise_time", "pol": "+", "when": "saturday"}], "tags": ["fluent"], "note": ""}
{"text": "一个星期内到，保证", "frames": [{"act": "promise_time", "pol": "+", "when": "7_days"}], "tags": ["fragment"], "note": ""}
{"text": "今天收工前我们就发出去，货明天到", "frames": [{"act": "resend", "pol": "+", "when": "today"}, {"act": "promise_time", "pol": "+", "when": "tomorrow"}], "tags": ["fluent"], "note": ""}
{"text": "明天重发一次，包装也换新的", "frames": [{"act": "resend", "pol": "+", "when": "tomorrow"}], "tags": ["fluent"], "note": ""}
{"text": "具体什么时候到，我们也不确定", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["negation"], "note": ""}
{"text": "您说我们答应过今天到，我们有说过吗？", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["quote", "question"], "note": ""}
{"text": "您上次投诉的事，我们后来有跟进", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["fluent"], "note": "只是陈述过去的跟进"}
{"text": "有人说我们收了钱不发货，这话不对", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["quote"], "note": "引用别人的话，没有给出具体动作"}
{"text": "对不起，这个真的没办法，我们帮不了", "frames": [{"act": "apologize", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "refuse", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["fluent"], "note": ""}
{"text": "抱歉，条件不允许，请您谅解", "frames": [{"act": "apologize", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "refuse", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["fluent"], "note": ""}
{"text": "我们又不是故意拖，供应商那边压货压了好久", "frames": [{"act": "deny_fault", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "cause", "pol": "+", "reason": "stock"}], "tags": ["negation"], "note": ""}
{"text": "如果没有台风就不会晚，真的倒霉", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["hypothetical"], "note": ""}
{"text": "您先别发火，我们已经在催工厂了", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["reassure"], "note": ""}
{"text": "货压在深圳仓，我们也被坑了，真不是我们的问题", "frames": [{"act": "cause", "pol": "+", "reason": "logistics"}, {"act": "deny_fault", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["fluent"], "note": ""}
{"text": "我哋唔系唔想补，系厂方未出货，周四补返", "frames": [{"act": "deny_fault", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "cause", "pol": "+", "reason": "factory"}, {"act": "resend", "pol": "+", "when": "thursday"}], "tags": ["negation", "mixed"], "note": ""}
